ust be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"writable as schema updates may be perfomed."}]}],"name":"filePath"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The completion handler to call once the contents of the given"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"file has been added to offline storage. This handler is executed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"asynchronously on the main queue."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"completion"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The file must be a valid offline pack database bundled with the application or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"downloaded separately.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The resulting packs are added or updated to the shared offline storage object’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"packs"},{"type":"text","text":" property, then the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"completion"},{"type":"text","text":" block is executed."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinestorage\/addcontentsoffile:withcompletionhandler:"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Adds the offline packs located at the given file path to offline storage."}],"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNOfflineStorage/addContentsOfFile:withCompletionHandler:":{"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"addContentsOfFile:withCompletionHandler:","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage\/addContentsOfFile:withCompletionHandler:","title":"addContentsOfFile:withCompletionHandler:","abstract":[{"text":"Adds the offline packs located at the given file path to offline storage.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinestorage\/addcontentsoffile:withcompletionhandler:"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNBatchedOfflinePackAdditionCompletionHandler":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A block to be called once the contents of a file are copied into the current packs."}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnbatchedofflinepackadditioncompletionhandler","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNBatchedOfflinePackAdditionCompletionHandler"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","title":"MLNBatchedOfflinePackAdditionCompletionHandler","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNBatchedOfflinePackAdditionCompletionHandler"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"title":"MapLibre","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNOfflineStorage":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"MLNOfflineStorage implements a singleton (shared object) that manages offline"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"packs and ambient caching. All of this class’s instance methods are asynchronous,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reflecting the fact that offline resources are stored in a database. The shared"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"object maintains a canonical collection of offline packs in its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"packs"},{"type":"text","text":" property."}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage","type":"topic","title":"MLNOfflineStorage","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinestorage","fragments":[{"text":"MLNOffli